{"ID":"20240314091111-rxmkg0x","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"2b50","id":"20240314091111-rxmkg0x","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091111-rxmkg0x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240322103946-outntvm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240507141440-35u4p76\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:7113,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240429115144-eklwkh4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:44,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:44\u0026#125;","title":"笔记","type":"doc","updated":"20240910092943"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240314091111-bec7yu9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240314091111-bec7yu9","updated":"20240314160128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1、三阴骨：头上的囱骨合上的时候，就开始有记忆了；耳后高骨长出来的时候，就开始有记忆了；脚上的膝盖骨长出来的时候，就能走路了；"}]},{"ID":"20240314160103-36c9fhw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240314160103-36c9fhw","updated":"20240421103655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、一般来说，用到生附子的时候，一定配合干姜，用到炮附子的时候，配合生姜；"}]},{"ID":"20240325150155-nxgqla7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240325150155-nxgqla7","updated":"20240325154305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2.1、炮附子能收表，生附子能加强心脏力量；"}]},{"ID":"20240605083422-cjftetf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240605083422-cjftetf","updated":"20240605083539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2.2、文字稿：心阳回来要靠生附子，肾阳回来要靠炮附子——该说法出自扶阳论坛，可在‘笔记-倪海厦-扶阳论坛’搜索查看上下文。"}]},{"ID":"20240314160628-h8l20f3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240314160628-h8l20f3","updated":"20240314161447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、桂枝强心只是让动脉里的血液循环加速，肉桂是让心脏力量加强；"}]},{"ID":"20240314161440-zwykl2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240314161440-zwykl2j","updated":"20240314162423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、人参可以用党参取代，遇到重症，最好直接用人参高丽参最好。"}]},{"ID":"20240314162424-hw2tzsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240314162424-hw2tzsn","updated":"20240315090530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、使用伤寒论中的经方，治愈后一段时间内病人应该注意饮食，因为肠胃虚弱，多食清单，少吃肉类，就连蛋也要少吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240315090531-c766hjs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315090531-c766hjs","updated":"20240315091120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"整本伤寒论，一共有113 个方子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，113方总得可以归纳为三个处方：一个是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"辛散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，利用辛散的药；第二个，利用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"寒泻"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"的药；第三个，利用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"温补"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240315090814-8ad7bcd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315090814-8ad7bcd","updated":"20240315091113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"辛散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：如麻黄桂枝辛香发散，目的是能够去寒、驱寒，把寒去掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240315090821-scm2ap3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315090821-scm2ap3","updated":"20240315091208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6.2、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"寒泻"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：如石膏、黄芩、黄连、大黄我们叫膏黄，膏黄是能够撤热，为什么要把热撤掉？因为要救阴，希望急下存阴，把阴保持住，目的在此；如人参能养阴退热；"}]},{"ID":"20240315090823-ctaaa0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315090823-ctaaa0z","updated":"20240315091115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6.3、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"温补"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：如姜附以辛热温补，它的目的是什么？目的是回阳，救逆用，病人阳不足了，我们会用温药，温热的药把他救回来。"}]},{"ID":"20240315091620-7vzex2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315091620-7vzex2d","updated":"20240315091708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6.4、太阳用麻桂；少阳用柴胡；阳明用葛根；少阴用细辛。这些药统统是辛散。"}]},{"ID":"20240314161357-nn7uotq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240314161357-nn7uotq","updated":"20240408112843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7、肝脏有问题，先实脾，防止传经，以此类推，治肾先治心；"}]},{"ID":"20240315141049-h9w0vnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315141049-h9w0vnn","updated":"20240315141440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8、肾有病的时候肾水会凌心，苦味入心，所以中医会用黄连解肾脏毒；"}]},{"ID":"20240315141406-147dzu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315141406-147dzu1","updated":"20240315142614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9、现代来说，人多以实症而死，少之以虚症而死。"}]},{"ID":"20240315142615-8cs3x97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315142615-8cs3x97","updated":"20240315150215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10、六个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"补虚的缺点"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（倪师临床经验）："}]},{"ID":"20240315144916-uy1psp2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315144916-uy1psp2","updated":"20240315150229"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（1）把"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"疟症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"作阴虚治，会造成"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"痞症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，心下痞；"}]},{"ID":"20240315144943-a79uyyd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315144943-a79uyyd","updated":"20240315150231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（2）把"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"下痢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"当作阴虚治，会造成"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"腹部臌胀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，肚子变大；"}]},{"ID":"20240315144948-pjzoa2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315144948-pjzoa2x","updated":"20240315150232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（3）把"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"咳嗽"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"当作阴虚治，会造成"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺萎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，肺萎缩掉；"}]},{"ID":"20240315144953-1oof4xz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315144953-1oof4xz","updated":"20240315150234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（4）把"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"痰饮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"当作阴虚治，会造成"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"浮肿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240315145003-5c87tba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315145003-5c87tba","updated":"20240315150236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（5）把"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"吐血、遗精、阳津不能守"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"当作阴虚治，会造成"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"劳症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240315145006-qtb6yss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315145006-qtb6yss","updated":"20240315150238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（6）把"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"湿堵在中焦"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"当作阴虚治，会造成"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"格"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，阴阳相格；"}]},{"ID":"20240315150216-f6kxvvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315150216-f6kxvvu","updated":"20240315150359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"11、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"非寒不泄"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。一定要用寒凉的药才能够把实泄掉；"}]},{"ID":"20240315150351-azi3pa8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315150351-azi3pa8","updated":"20240315150421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"11.1、文字稿：我们在处方的时候我们常常会看到，像厥阴篇后面，我们用附子，黄芩，黄连，干姜。老师：这个黄芩黄连跟附子干姜还用在一起，张仲景还用在这个处方里，为什么？就是非寒不泄。；"}]},{"ID":"20240315150422-w5szdyf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315150422-w5szdyf","updated":"20240315160204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"12、鼻头也就是山根处，有一条青色的血管，腹痛时代表是小建中汤证（小肠太冷了）；"}]},{"ID":"20240315160150-7jvoris","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315160150-7jvoris","updated":"20240315160150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240315155755-stkeb49.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240315160455-bodon9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315160455-bodon9j","updated":"20240315160616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"12.1、‘鼻头色微黑者，有水气’；鼻头颜色微黑色的，病人肾脏有问题，有水气相关的病；"}]},{"ID":"20240315160526-jlogp11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315160526-jlogp11","updated":"20240315160628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"12.2、‘颜色黄者，胸上有寒’；鼻头颜色黄色的，代表胸腔有寒；"}]},{"ID":"20240315160731-fcr4j1s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315160731-fcr4j1s","updated":"20240315160752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"12.3、“设微赤非时者死”，（山根）这个地方呢，如果是冬天秋天，冬天和秋天。比如心是火，这个心火在这里。如果是秋天、冬天，应该看到白色、黑色，结果呢，看到（山根）这个地方呢，是赤色，就是非时，节气不对，心脏有问题，这种都是死症。"}]},{"ID":"20240315160133-4u2nb72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240315160133-4u2nb72","updated":"20240318103749"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"13、卒厥，就是西医所谓的脑中风；"}]},{"ID":"20240318103750-flhffn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318103750-flhffn0","updated":"20240318103953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"14、扎针病往四肢走或只剩四肢有症状，说明病在退，如果病往躯干走，则为病进。"}]},{"ID":"20240318103953-7ksudr2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318103953-7ksudr2","updated":"20240318105740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"15、极寒会伤到经，极热会伤到络；"}]},{"ID":"20240318105740-gzi8xij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318105740-gzi8xij","updated":"20240318110932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"16、夫病痼疾，加以卒病，当先治其其卒病，后乃治其痼疾也。"}]},{"ID":"20240318110933-vlx4re1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318110933-vlx4re1","updated":"20240318111021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"16.1、病人本来就有陈年的痼疾，突然又有临时发生的病，这时先治新病，再治旧病；"}]},{"ID":"20240318111021-tb7r5xn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318111021-tb7r5xn","updated":"20240318112043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"17、泽泻利全身水；茯苓利三焦水；猪苓利下焦水；"}]},{"ID":"20240318112027-2v0hc35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318112027-2v0hc35","updated":"20240318112048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"17.1、文字稿：每天早上起来的时候，脸是肿的，就是叫你吃泽泻嘛，老师我肚子很大，怎么办？茯苓嘛，老师我小腹特别突出来，那女孩子特别讨厌小腹，小腹往外突怎么办？用猪苓嘛，就马上就分开来了；"}]},{"ID":"20240318112050-fqvvzy3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318112050-fqvvzy3","updated":"20240318112605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"18、太阳病，发热、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"无汗、反恶寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"者，名曰刚痉。太阳病发热"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"汗出"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，而"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"不恶寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，名曰柔痉"}]},{"ID":"20240318114317-zdeb4m6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318114317-zdeb4m6","updated":"20240318114321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"19、一个人肠胃很好就会很健康不会生病了；"}]},{"ID":"20240318114322-cwcfaav","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318114322-cwcfaav","updated":"20240318135007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"20、麻黄使用时要去节，才能有效果，麻黄节是止汗的；"}]},{"ID":"20240318140232-bhqx2ls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318140232-bhqx2ls","updated":"20240318140458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"21、治疗痉只有三个处方：栝蒌桂枝汤（柔痉）、葛根汤（刚痉）、大承气汤（胸满口噤，卧不着席）；"}]},{"ID":"20240318140459-oghyu1e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318140459-oghyu1e","updated":"20240318141652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"22、药物生用取其迅捷，如芒硝生用速度很快；"}]},{"ID":"20240318141628-8iu0e0h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318141628-8iu0e0h","updated":"20240318153212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"23、麻黄跟杏仁搭配，杏仁能防止麻黄发汗太过，就好像桂枝跟芍药搭配；"}]},{"ID":"20240328154137-n735qei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240328154137-n735qei","updated":"20240328154157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"23.1、文字稿：杏仁跟麻黄，两个是秤不离砣，砣不离秤，两个等量的时候，你再重，麻黄都不会出问题；"}]},{"ID":"20240318143536-mc203ck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318143536-mc203ck","updated":"20240318154019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"24、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"湿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"在皮肤：麻黄加术汤；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"湿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"深入到肌肉：麻杏薏甘汤；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"湿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"更深入在血管周围：防己黄芪汤；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"湿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"再进一步进入血脉：桂枝芍药知母汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240318153838-zec3uok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318153838-zec3uok","updated":"20240318154604"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"25、少运动导致的发福，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"减肥"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：防己黄芪汤（防己黄芪汤是最适合给运动少导致增肥尤其是妇女的减肥方）；"}]},{"ID":"20240318154451-bygnd6d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318154451-bygnd6d","updated":"20240318154701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"26、身重是湿的一个很标准的一个症状，有湿就感觉到身重；"}]},{"ID":"20240318154701-7xjcq1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318154701-7xjcq1d","updated":"20240318155753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"27、防己呢能够把药引导在血脉旁边；"}]},{"ID":"20240318155753-74xea40","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318155753-74xea40","updated":"20240318164129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"28、没有固定一点痛的时候，针灸开四关：太冲、合谷，痛点即显现；"}]},{"ID":"20240318164121-20ynsm1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318164121-20ynsm1","updated":"20240318172557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"29、湿很盛的人，不可攻下；"}]},{"ID":"20240318172557-bx9acx9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318172557-bx9acx9","updated":"20240319115105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"30、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"排脓汤有两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"个：一是术附汤，二是赤豆当归散；"}]},{"ID":"20240318172920-2qjbd93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318172920-2qjbd93","updated":"20240319115108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"30.1、术附汤：脓疡在骨头或蔓延到骨头；或脓疡呢是在皮肤下面，或者肌肉里面很深的地方，我们要让它发出来，要靠术附汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240319111025-97va19z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319111025-97va19z","updated":"20240319111128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"30.2、赤豆当归散：胆囊破裂或者腹膜炎破裂产生的脓，要靠赤豆当归散排除（使用注意赤豆要用发芽的）；"}]},{"ID":"20240318173133-nbmjzxw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240318173133-nbmjzxw","updated":"20240319085811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"31、中暑经方只有两个处方，一个是白虎加人参汤，一个是瓜蒂散；"}]},{"ID":"20240319085811-aogz71j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319085811-aogz71j","updated":"20240319091934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"32、百合这个药是食物里面最好消化的一个东西；"}]},{"ID":"20240319091935-gp5ltwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319091935-gp5ltwh","updated":"20240319094202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"33、抗忧郁的药吃多了容易自杀；"}]},{"ID":"20240319094202-asuyygf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319094202-asuyygf","updated":"20240319095654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"34、知母，是除烦躁的圣药；"}]},{"ID":"20240319095654-aibynod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319095654-aibynod","updated":"20240319101218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"35、百合病，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"无误治"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，百合地黄汤；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"误发汗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，百合知母汤；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"误下之"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，百合滑石代赭汤；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"误吐之"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，百合鸡子汤；一月不解，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"有渴症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，百合洗方；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"渴整不解者"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，栝蒌牡蛎散；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"变发热者"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，百合滑石散；"}]},{"ID":"20240319102326-q26fi2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319102326-q26fi2n","updated":"20240319102613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"36、百合病特点，症状很多所以称之为百合，偏向于神经质，一般发生于两种条件下：一是大病初愈，二是长久抑郁，如忧郁症；"}]},{"ID":"20240319102614-0fwh0pg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319102614-0fwh0pg","updated":"20240319103353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"37、狐惑病特点：像梦游，像得了性病，或者是寄生虫，都会有狐惑的现象出现。还有凭依证等。"}]},{"ID":"20240319103354-ll5xnca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319103354-ll5xnca","updated":"20240319103533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"37.1、文字稿："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"什么叫凭依症？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"比如你养一只猫，猫躲在箱子里面你不晓得，你把箱子盖起来，结果你关了它三天，你一打开箱子的时候，它突然跳出来，猫很气哦，对你大叫一声。从那个时候开始这个病人开始动作就像猫了。这就叫做凭依症。"}]},{"ID":"20240319101118-k4ddt9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319101118-k4ddt9u","updated":"20240319103604"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"38、文字稿：一般来说黄连，黄芩都是用在肠胃上面，黄柏呢，三黄泻心汤里面呢有黄柏，黄柏大部分用在肾脏方面，所以肾脏有虚热的时候，我们会用黄柏下去。所以黄柏看起来好像是去热的药，实际上是补肾脏的药，可以滋阴的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240319103617-k5y1oyd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319103617-k5y1oyd","updated":"20240319103812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"39、安眠药的副作用就是梦游；"}]},{"ID":"20240319103755-gu85kqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319103755-gu85kqc","updated":"20240319111534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"40、当归不用需冷藏，我们用当归一般是用里面的油脂，如果当归是干瘪的，当归药性就没有了。"}]},{"ID":"20240319111535-zn3rd41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319111535-zn3rd41","updated":"20240319135702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"41、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"蜀椒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"能打寄生虫，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"升麻"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"能解热毒，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"雄黄"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"能解虫蛇咬伤的毒还有疮毒；"}]},{"ID":"20240319135657-92o7bbx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319135657-92o7bbx","updated":"20240319135843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"42、雄黄一般生用，煮了之后会变成砒霜；"}]},{"ID":"20240319135844-rrrs1iy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319135844-rrrs1iy","updated":"20240319140643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"43、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳毒和阴毒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳毒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用升麻鳖甲汤，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"阴毒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用升麻鳖甲汤去雄黄蜀椒；"}]},{"ID":"20240319103650-b5jxil1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319103650-b5jxil1","updated":"20240319141535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"44、无痰不疟，疟病一定会有痰；"}]},{"ID":"20240319141535-8wgwt9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319141535-8wgwt9o","updated":"20240319143825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"45、药物取其性，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"树枝类"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"药物能到四肢上，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"花、花蕾类"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"药物能到鼻脑，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"根茎类"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"药物能到肠胃；"}]},{"ID":"20240319143808-bvq76v4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319143808-bvq76v4","updated":"20240319144841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"46、蜀漆跟常山不一样，但如果找不到蜀漆，可以用常山替代；"}]},{"ID":"20240319144841-9w7j57j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319144841-9w7j57j","updated":"20240319151057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"47、怎么判断胃气将绝：一是打嗝，二是脉如钩；"}]},{"ID":"20240319151058-c68k38m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319151058-c68k38m","updated":"20240319152159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"48、中风有先兆（倪师的统计）：一是没有原因的失眠；二是手指麻（拇指、食指、中指），两三个月左右就会中风；第三个呢，足胫骨麻，两个礼拜内就会中风；"}]},{"ID":"20240319152245-mz5zas8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319152245-mz5zas8","updated":"20240319152310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"48.1、中风主要原因还是气血不足，如果人气血旺，不会有突发的中风症状出现；"}]},{"ID":"20240319151549-qeaktrw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319151549-qeaktrw","updated":"20240319151556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"49、人会睡觉呢，是因为有三个条件，肝藏魂，心藏神，脾藏意。哦，当我们血够的时候，血会归肝，人就可以睡得很好。当你血不够的时候，肝里面缺血，半夜就醒过来，就没有办法睡得很好；"}]},{"ID":"20240319151621-2ms19uj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319151621-2ms19uj","updated":"20240319151654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"49.1、文字稿：心是藏神，那这个神呢就是你的注意力，你可以睡得很好，那如果这个心脏里面的血不够，神没有办法呆在心脏里面，这个神出去了，神游哦，就会造成失眠也是血虚的状态之下。像脾藏意，你想，没有办法......脑筋没有办法停下来，所以我们为什么要去打坐，打坐呢可以让你心情很静下来，你不会想很多。"}]},{"ID":"20240319151556-q9oy7z1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319151556-q9oy7z1","updated":"20240319162007"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"50、中风有两症：寒与热；百分之九十为寒，百分之十为热，所以中风常见为寒症，如遇到热症，用风引汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240319161927-0a34if9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319161927-0a34if9","updated":"20240319162106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"50.1、寒则缩，热则纵——黄帝内经；寒症的人手脚都是拘谨的，热症的人手脚都是摊开的；"}]},{"ID":"20240319162926-gndjk9g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319162926-gndjk9g","updated":"20240319162951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"51、经方里面用的盐，都是青盐，实在没有青盐再用海盐，不能用人工盐；"}]},{"ID":"20240319162951-apsxq65","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319162951-apsxq65","updated":"20240319165047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"52、细辛能够增加人的胆气；让人更大胆的药，是大麻，大麻不容易上瘾；"}]},{"ID":"20240319164600-uayabqz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319164600-uayabqz","updated":"20240319174825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"53、地龙，活血也伤血，所以说除非必要，不要用到动物的药来攻血；"}]},{"ID":"20240319174826-2uu8d13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319174826-2uu8d13","updated":"20240605083416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"54、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝跟炮附子都能壮心阳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"主要药性在于壮心脏的火，强它的火，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"主要药性在于将心火下降到小肠里；"}]},{"ID":"20240320141110-xztm8q8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240320141110-xztm8q8","updated":"20240320141834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"55、人工糖吃进嘴里是甜的，实际到胃里是酸性的，伤肝；"}]},{"ID":"20240320141830-l036upz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240320141830-l036upz","updated":"20240320165925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"56、遗精有三种：一种是梦与女子交（症状较轻）；不做梦都遗精（中等）；白天清醒情况下都遗精（严重）；三者都可用桂枝龙骨牡蛎汤对治；"}]},{"ID":"20240319164552-vn3ch2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319164552-vn3ch2s","updated":"20240321104839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"57、附子、乌头、天雄是同一株本草，三年收为附子，四年收为乌头，五年收为天雄；"}]},{"ID":"20240321104839-w08uika","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321104839-w08uika","updated":"20240321114822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"58、医者，不知阴阳，无以为医；"}]},{"ID":"20240321114823-nlhvx0u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321114823-nlhvx0u","updated":"20240321114843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"58.1、这个阴阳不只是诊断，处方也要讲究阴阳；"}]},{"ID":"20240321114754-yp0vux1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321114754-yp0vux1","updated":"20240321115405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"59、桂枝汤中桂枝是主动脉，芍药是主静脉；"}]},{"ID":"20240321115401-77rzhsm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321115401-77rzhsm","updated":"20240321115809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"60、张仲景是用寒药来做泄的动作，寒泻的目的是撤热；"}]},{"ID":"20240321115746-aaw78he","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321115746-aaw78he","updated":"20240321142539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"61、皮肤下陷，为阴不足，可用芍药对治；"}]},{"ID":"20240321142909-2rsim0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321142909-2rsim0z","updated":"20240321142950"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"62、人参张仲景主要用于养胃阴，所以独参汤用于救逆，主要是用于救胃气没有的逆；"}]},{"ID":"20240321142950-jys8tke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321142950-jys8tke","updated":"20240321144504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"63、真正好的处方，滋补的药是补泻兼顾，绝对不可以开纯补的药哦，纯补的药是西洋人搞出来的；"}]},{"ID":"20240321144504-yswelqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321144504-yswelqs","updated":"20240321150631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"64、瘀不去，新不生；"}]},{"ID":"20240321150631-eezoeu9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321150631-eezoeu9","updated":"20240321151051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"65、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肌肤甲错只设定在足三里到三阴交的中间的地方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，躯干不属于肌肤甲错所指；"}]},{"ID":"20240321151034-tm9h9oo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321151034-tm9h9oo","updated":"20240321160639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"66、肩息：呼吸的时候要动肩膀打开肺，才能正常呼吸；"}]},{"ID":"20240321160642-6u5iahm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321160642-6u5iahm","updated":"20240321163649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"67、消渴有三：上消：渴饮千杯不能止渴；中消：饥食百碗不能解饥；下消：阳不举；"}]},{"ID":"20240321163702-t4hm8fe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321163702-t4hm8fe","updated":"20240321163727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"67.1、上消、中消可用白虎加人参汤加减，下消用桂附八味丸；"}]},{"ID":"20240321163728-gf2crl8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321163728-gf2crl8","updated":"20240321170104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"68、肾可纳气，一呼一吸中，吸入为肾，吐出为肺；"}]},{"ID":"20240321170058-c9pqdco","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321170058-c9pqdco","updated":"20240321170155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"68.1、黄帝内经中，倪师也提及呼吸：呼出靠的是心肺（阳），吸入靠的是肝肾（阴），呼吸中间过程就是脾胃作用；"}]},{"ID":"20240321170159-axznou0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321170159-axznou0","updated":"20240322083806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"69、治疗咳嗽痰饮的时候，甘味会增腻，就是反而会增加痰饮，所以治咳嗽的时候一般不用甘味药；"}]},{"ID":"20240322103946-outntvm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240322103946-outntvm","updated":"20240322104021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"70、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"肺癌会下痢的原因"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：文字过多，见视频同步文字稿——奔豚气病脉证并治第八；"}]},{"ID":"20240322104016-o7aca1s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240322104016-o7aca1s","updated":"20240322104826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"71、脏腑之所以有表里，如肺与大肠想表里，肾与膀胱相表里，是因为有三焦系统连贯到；"}]},{"ID":"20240322115251-7ylr1zl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240322115251-7ylr1zl","updated":"20240322115333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"72、有奔豚的现象，出现动悸，肚脐以下要想到使用茯苓，肚脐以上要想到桂枝；"}]},{"ID":"20240322115309-zjgfuo6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240322115309-zjgfuo6","updated":"20240322151521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"73、心脏跳54下以上，停一下，这是正常的——出自黄帝内经。"}]},{"ID":"20240322151521-4jprbzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240322151521-4jprbzs","updated":"20240322151605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"73.1、如果心脏是每五下停一下，那心脏还可以用五年；如果是十下一止就是还可以用十年。"}]},{"ID":"20240322160532-jl1qysj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240322160532-jl1qysj","updated":"20240322160542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"74、心脏结构有问题时，背后第五椎有压痛点；"}]},{"ID":"20240325145749-lhu1pd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240325145749-lhu1pd0","updated":"20240325145909"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"74.1、动脉血管堵到：耳朵的‘心点’有压痛；"}]},{"ID":"20240322162746-j7khdy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240322162746-j7khdy8","updated":"20240322164057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"75、枳实入心，入心的话它就会入小肠，枳实能生小肠津液；"}]},{"ID":"20240322164057-2aj1riy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240322164057-2aj1riy","updated":"20240325094954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"76、治心脏病有个诀窍，提醒病人要保冷，心喜寒，保持寒冷有益心脏；"}]},{"ID":"20240325094954-revvr51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240325094954-revvr51","updated":"20240325141300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"76.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"文字稿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：我治疗心脏病的时候，我就会跟病人说，我开始今天帮你治疗啊，下完针，你现在开始每天用冷水去冲脚，每天晚上睡觉前，或者没有事情的时候，电视少看一点，跑去冲，用冷水冲脚。那他说为什么？因为你冷水一冲脚的时候，那个冷的一刺激到脚，脚是离心脏最远的地方。刚开始一两分钟，一两分钟的时候觉得水很冰。但是你一直用那个冰水在冲脚的时候，心脏会收到讯号，诶，太冷了。心脏力量会自己会发动，就会开始搏动，把热导到脚上去。所以你同样是冷水，你不断的冲，一两，一分钟、二分钟到第三分钟以后，你以为水是热的，然后你再去摸，诶，水还是冰的啊，可是你感觉到水冲到脚上是热的，为什么？就是因为你刺激他的心脏。让心脏自己来痊愈。哦，那夏天的时候呢，你用洗冷水澡，冬天的时候叫心脏病的病人去洗冷水澡实在是折磨对不对，用冷水冲脚，夏天的时候最好洗冷水澡。哦，所以治心脏病要保冷。所以很多人呢，冬天到出外去，心脏病的病人呢，少穿一件外套就不容易得心脏病，不容易发心脏病。反而你把身体包的太暖，反而容易得到心脏病，这都是来自黄帝内经的。"}]},{"ID":"20240325141249-48nwpkh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240325141249-48nwpkh","updated":"20240325141302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"76.2、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"文字稿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：你只要会治心脏病，刚刚的处方呢跟七种癌症：乳癌、红斑性狼疮、肝癌、肺癌、脑瘤、哦，淋巴癌都有关系，因为这些都是心脏引起的，所以你会治心脏病以后，所有因为心脏有问题产生的其他的变症、其他的症状、其他的癌症什么通通在这里可以得到治疗，因为你把心脏治好，根源就去掉了，你如果心脏病治不好、没有办法治好心脏，其他的病不会好"}]},{"ID":"20240325095825-2bsvf5f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240325095825-2bsvf5f","updated":"20240325100745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"77、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"张仲景用到胸满，心脏痛、胸满的时候一律用枳实，腹满的时候一律用这个厚朴，肚子腹痛的时候一律用白芍；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240325100739-f3xsirt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240325100739-f3xsirt","updated":"20240325102231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"78、治心的时候，治疗心脏的时候我们会去治肺，同时呢强肝，因为肝是心之母。木生火"}]},{"ID":"20240325102231-4zc7l81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240325102231-4zc7l81","updated":"20240325103318"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"79、最严重的心痛彻背，背痛彻心时，原因是纵膈腔的浓痰导致；该痰用半夏、南星不见得能去掉，用皂荚丸也不行，皂荚丸是去肺中汤；所以张仲景认为这种痰必须苦温才能化湿，所以乌梅酸苦药势可用；"}]},{"ID":"20240325103303-ywj21b8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240325103303-ywj21b8","updated":"20240325105356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"80、动脉堵塞特征：第一个病人一定是失眠，哦，没有原因的失眠。第二个大便不规则，第三个手脚冷，第四个心胸痛、心口痛；"}]},{"ID":"20240325105356-5o8up0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240325105356-5o8up0x","updated":"20240325115654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"81、一般来说，动脉血管会堵塞会硬化，临床上看的时候，都是这个病人的确是爱吃油炸的;"}]},{"ID":"20240325103042-9o4hl3a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240325103042-9o4hl3a","updated":"20240325115722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"82、人体是一个太极，寒极生热，热极生寒；"}]},{"ID":"20240325115723-eu1yzfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240325115723-eu1yzfs","updated":"20240325155233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"83、甘草味甜，炙过后味苦入心，又有甘味能强心，所以炙甘草汤重用炙甘草能够对治心律不齐；"}]},{"ID":"20240325155233-himzg4p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240325155233-himzg4p","updated":"20240325163343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"84、甘淡渗利为阳，酸苦涌泄为阴；"}]},{"ID":"20240325163343-94u966p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240325163343-94u966p","updated":"20240325170028"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"85、神阙（肚脐）是阴阳交界的地方，刚好是太极图正中间的一个地方。"}]},{"ID":"20240325170028-mn0go7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240325170028-mn0go7w","updated":"20240326082012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"86、寒实：上焦寒实（三物小白散）；中焦寒实（甘草干姜汤）；下焦寒实（大黄附子细辛汤）；"}]},{"ID":"20240326082013-haqdvyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240326082013-haqdvyj","updated":"20240326084331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"87、小青龙用在表寒里寒，大青龙用在表寒里热；大乌头煎用在寒疝；"}]},{"ID":"20240326083907-a2524dl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240326083907-a2524dl","updated":"20240326083927"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"87.1、寒疝的定义：上、中、下焦都寒；"}]},{"ID":"20240326083959-m6roq3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240326083959-m6roq3u","updated":"20240326091807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"88、羊肉是最好的肉，比牛肉猪肉都好；"}]},{"ID":"20240326091807-oz4vaso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240326091807-oz4vaso","updated":"20240326100011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"89、头痛位置在前额，可能腹中有宿食；"}]},{"ID":"20240326095956-521phcy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240326095956-521phcy","updated":"20240326102420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"90、文字稿：中医里的观念里面有三个津液，酸的味道、甜的味道，还有苦的味道，进入我们的肠胃里面，这是胃的津液的来源，所以有脾脏的甜味、胆的苦味、肝脏的酸味混合成为我们胃的津液；"}]},{"ID":"20240326091741-fphx7cg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240326091741-fphx7cg","updated":"20240326105906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"91、心藏神，肝藏魂，肺藏魄，魂与魄都由神在管；"}]},{"ID":"20240326105907-mjbvi9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240326105907-mjbvi9c","updated":"20240326155029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"92、肾脏病水肿会有口渴小便不利的情况，肾着病则不口渴，小便利；这就是肾着病跟一般肾脏病水肿不一样的地方；"}]},{"ID":"20240326155029-bfz3hrn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240326155029-bfz3hrn","updated":"20240327150901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"93、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"治疗任何的癌症经方家的观念，第一个就是要把痰水阻绝掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，没有水病毒就没法生存，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二个是把病毒的营养给阻绝掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，吃原生的食物，营养才能补到人而不补到病毒；"}]},{"ID":"20240326155027-zxki383","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240326155027-zxki383","updated":"20240327152209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"94、西药阿司匹林会把血管破坏掉。管壁会变薄；"}]},{"ID":"20240327161101-vhzl721","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240327161101-vhzl721","updated":"20240327161141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"95、问曰：夫饮有四，何谓也？师曰：有痰饮，有悬饮，有溢饮，有支饮；"}]},{"ID":"20240327152209-8mwv335","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240327152209-8mwv335","updated":"20240327161144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"96、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"痰饮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：其人素盛今瘦，水走肠间，沥沥有声，谓之痰饮"}]},{"ID":"20240327160856-6wa41xp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240327160856-6wa41xp","updated":"20240327161402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"96.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"文字稿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：本来很胖的，现在很瘦，肚子里面咕噜咕噜常常有些水声，这种都是痰饮"}]},{"ID":"20240327160936-0haaub3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240327160936-0haaub3","updated":"20240327161148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"97、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"悬饮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：饮后水流在胁下，咳唾引痛，谓之悬饮；"}]},{"ID":"20240327160949-akd8ulh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240327160949-akd8ulh","updated":"20240327161404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"97.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"文字稿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：病人真的是这样子的感觉哦，“奇怪，我怎么喝水一喝下去，感觉到水就往肋间跑，肋骨，两肋去跑”。病人就是这样子告诉你的。那临床上看悬饮的时候，就是我们这个十枣汤症。"}]},{"ID":"20240327160953-t819r83","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240327160953-t819r83","updated":"20240327161406"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"98、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"溢饮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：饮水流行，归于四肢，当汗出而不汗出，身体疼痛重，谓之溢饮；"}]},{"ID":"20240327160957-cx7psdx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240327160957-cx7psdx","updated":"20240327161532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"98.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"文字稿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：这就是四肢有水肿，四肢水肿，喝水下去水都跑到四肢上面去了；"}]},{"ID":"20240327160959-5zacr4m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240327160959-5zacr4m","updated":"20240327161537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"99、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"支饮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：咳逆倚息，不得卧，其形如肿，谓之支饮；"}]},{"ID":"20240327161002-hpyvhqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240327161002-hpyvhqc","updated":"20240327161540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"99.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"文字稿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：这个支饮呢，就是比如说肺，水跑到肺里面去了，造成呢，病人坐在那边不能平躺，一定要坐在那边，然后咳嗽很严重；"}]},{"ID":"20240327161540-c7vylkj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240327161540-c7vylkj","updated":"20240327172901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"100、饮病，按程度有‘饮’‘留饮’‘伏饮’；饮为轻，伏饮最重，留饮次之；"}]},{"ID":"20240327172901-coj7c71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240327172901-coj7c71","updated":"20240328090423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"101、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"文字稿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：这里诸位要有个概念，我们吃的食物里面也有水，喝的饮料里面也有水。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"这个饮料的水呢，是在胃里面就气化掉了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，所以你一喝，一到胃里面就散发掉了。食物呢，里面也有水，是到了小肠里面。小肠消化掉以后呢，变成水还有食物的残渣。好，再入大肠，进入大肠以后呢，小肠的火再去蒸化大肠里的水，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"那食物里面的水呢，就跑到血里面去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，所以我们验血，血里面的水分是从食物的水来的，好，如果你吃的东西不对，那你血糖比较高，比如你吃白米、白面，那血糖比较高，因为就是食物里的水会跑到血里面去。"}]},{"ID":"20240328090418-5ra35sa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240328090418-5ra35sa","updated":"20240328090425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"好，那喝的水，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"饮料的水就会跑到三焦，跑到淋巴系统，（与食物中的水）跑到的不是一样的系统，就跑到血管的外边"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。所以我们身上有很多的肌肉里面，脏腑之间有很多的津液，这些都是饮来的，喝水喝来的，这是一个基本上的概念。你如果说吃的很少喝得很多，胃没有办法，你喝太多了，你胃火不够，平常就是素虚的人嘛，像我的胃火很强啊，就是几加仑的水喝下去也不会这样子。这个本来就是虚弱的人，喝水喝很多，冷水就停在胃里面，严重的会动悸。因为胃的上方就是心脏，那么这个水呢，这个寒气，水是寒的嘛！不断的往上冲，病人就会有动悸的现象，微者短气，好，就是比较轻微的呼吸，因为胃里面太冷了嘛，呼吸下去就出来，一呼吸就出来，你没有办法呼吸得很深。"}]},{"ID":"20240328085537-zcw8zhv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240328085537-zcw8zhv","updated":"20240328094630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"102、伏脉：如果这个伏脉，沉在底下是很细而且附骨，那是积脉哦，他这个脉是伏，沉在底下，沉在骨边，你一按他就没有了，这就叫伏脉；"}]},{"ID":"20240328094630-mrprydl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240328094630-mrprydl","updated":"20240328113316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"103、十枣汤和甘遂半夏汤的区别："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"十枣汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"是在肺底下有水，病人不能平躺，一定是坐在那里；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘遂半夏汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"呢是在肋间里面有积水，肋膜那地方有积水可以躺平；"}]},{"ID":"20240328145805-6ilgoxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240328145805-6ilgoxo","updated":"20240328145847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"104、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"文字稿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：不管中医、西医都有一句话叫做，医生都怕治疗咳嗽，所以咳嗽如果久治没有好，一直治还是没有好，这个饮没有去掉就成为悬饮；"}]},{"ID":"20240328145809-pqpj7ri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240328145809-pqpj7ri","updated":"20240328161354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"105、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"脸是诸阳之汇，头啊没有阴经只有阳经，所以阳没有的时候就会跑到脸上去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240328161234-maglorn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240328161234-maglorn","updated":"20240328161623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"105.1、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"比如肾脏有问题，肾阳不足，肾阴就会外泄跑到脸上，脸色呈黑色"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240328161437-yl6g63s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240328161437-yl6g63s","updated":"20240328161620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"105.2、食物营养由脾脏统一来分配，白色的给肺脏，红色的给心脏，黑色的给肾脏，青色的给肝脏，黄色的自己留在脾上"}]},{"ID":"20240328161526-y0sbj5n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240328161526-y0sbj5n","updated":"20240328162812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"106、久病会有两种情形：一是必有淤，二是有宿食；"}]},{"ID":"20240328162909-vqrplrt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240328162909-vqrplrt","updated":"20240328162938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"106.1、久病必有淤出自唐容川；有宿食就是有陈年的食物没有排出来；"}]},{"ID":"20240328162813-bi2ted3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240328162813-bi2ted3","updated":"20240329114301"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"107、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一型糖尿病呢，根本就是打疫苗或者吃西药引起的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240329114302-4i8cpch","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240329114302-4i8cpch","updated":"20240329115838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"108、十个糖尿病病人里面到后来十个脚都有问题。"}]},{"ID":"20240329115838-c3aepx3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240329115838-c3aepx3","updated":"20240329115939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"109、聪明的人从别人身上学到教训，笨的人从自己身上学到教训；"}]},{"ID":"20240329115939-qs88lo5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240329115939-qs88lo5","updated":"20240401140837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"110、翟麦、土茯苓，可用于治疗淋病；"}]},{"ID":"20240401140825-5ku2rf1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240401140825-5ku2rf1","updated":"20240401162614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"111、经方家治重证的时候，时常生姜和干姜并在一起用；"}]},{"ID":"20240401162614-q0ahv1q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240401162614-q0ahv1q","updated":"20240401163201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"112、小便时吸一口气，吐气时用力把小便喷射出来，可以练肾脏；"}]},{"ID":"20240401163134-g2id625","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240401163134-g2id625","updated":"20240401163236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"113、实际上麻黄附子细辛汤并不是发汗的，麻黄附子细辛汤是利尿的；"}]},{"ID":"20240401163236-mfuk3i6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240401163236-mfuk3i6","updated":"20240402084812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"114、水病：有风水，有皮水，有正水，有石水，有黄汗；"}]},{"ID":"20240402084813-90v85js","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240402084813-90v85js","updated":"20240402085042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"114.1、风水脉浮，外症骨节疼痛，恶风；"}]},{"ID":"20240402084821-721nrc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240402084821-721nrc6","updated":"20240402085202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"114.2、皮水其脉亦浮，外症浮肿，脚踝裸内部肿起来。指头一按就凹下去一块，外证呢按之没指，不恶风，其腹如鼓，不渴，当发其汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240402084823-zfxu62q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240402084823-zfxu62q","updated":"20240402091047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"114.3、正水其脉沉迟，外证自喘；"}]},{"ID":"20240402084825-970eakn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240402084825-970eakn","updated":"20240402093522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"114.4、石水，其脉自沉，外证腹满不喘；"}]},{"ID":"20240401141434-gxturog","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240401141434-gxturog","updated":"20240402093526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"114.5、黄汗其脉沉迟，身发热，胸满，四肢头面肿，久不愈，必致痈脓；"}]},{"ID":"20240402092044-hb64g6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240402092044-hb64g6g","updated":"20240402092054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"115、肚脐以上采吐法，肚脐以下采攻下。如果全身性的病我们采汗法；"}]},{"ID":"20240402092049-g4unm88","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240402092049-g4unm88","updated":"20240402094020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"116、文字稿：不单单是黄汗，任何的水肿，不管是风水、石水、皮水。任何的水你没有把它排掉，皮肤都容易化痈脓；因为新水没有办法去取代旧水。"}]},{"ID":"20240402092100-gifjvld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240402092100-gifjvld","updated":"20240402171829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"117、文字稿："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"凡是有水有病，身上有积水的人呢，有四大症状"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：第一个，眼睛目眶呢有卧蚕，那个眼袋很大；还有呢，第二个，脸目呢很鲜泽，因为有水在里面哦，第三个，这个病人呢是脉是伏的，伏在那边，沉潜在下面，第四个，消渴病水，消渴就是渴，很渴，然后喝水呢不能止渴，这种都有水病。"}]},{"ID":"20240402171823-0aqyng3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240402171823-0aqyng3","updated":"20240406102936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"118、睡醒，如发现脚肿源自心脏有问题，如脸肿源自肾脏有问题；"}]},{"ID":"20240406102859-9yw23jn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240406102859-9yw23jn","updated":"20240406154642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"119、硫磺是因为它很热产生的毒，它本身并没有毒；硫磺毒能用鸭肉解；"}]},{"ID":"20240406102841-u5ryobg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240406102841-u5ryobg","updated":"20240406162323"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"120、任何脉，你摸到沉脉，就是病在里面的意思，滑呢则于实，里面有实；"}]},{"ID":"20240406162323-nvgov3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240406162323-nvgov3v","updated":"20240407083354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"121、治喉咙的时候，一定要会治肾，治疗肾。你如果不知道喉病是跟肾有关系，那喉咙病治不好；"}]},{"ID":"20240407083354-1w51685","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240407083354-1w51685","updated":"20240407085320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"122、正常人体内阴阳是互相制衡的，阳足则阴不会乱窜，阳不足阴就会乱窜；"}]},{"ID":"20240407085320-wmrv90j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240407085320-wmrv90j","updated":"20240407090716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"123、判断一个人阳气足方法很简单，看头发，头发越黑越亮代表阳气足；"}]},{"ID":"20240407090716-y7jbi85","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240407090716-y7jbi85","updated":"20240407093609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"124、防己入三焦系统，所以防己能够通利三焦；茯苓能够利水，是因为能生成油，三焦油网里面的油；"}]},{"ID":"20240407093610-41hw2c6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240407093610-41hw2c6","updated":"20240407094430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"125、不要小气用药，比如当你知道牡蛎可以攻坚，因为牡蛎是味咸，咸能软坚，牡蛎又吃不死人，大剂用；"}]},{"ID":"20240407094409-oscn4dr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240407094409-oscn4dr","updated":"20240407102805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"126、麻黄不仅能发汗，还能敛汗，详见越婢汤条文；"}]},{"ID":"20240407102806-097fv3i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240407102806-097fv3i","updated":"20240407104121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"127、文字稿：病在风水的时候，初症的时候没有渴，病比较久的时候，病人都会渴，所以从当你当进入皮水以后呢，就出现渴症"}]},{"ID":"20240407104121-94xtowl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240407104121-94xtowl","updated":"20240408083237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"128、文字稿："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"我们的小承气汤、大承气汤、调胃承气汤，很多地方呢我们会用到枳实，大柴胡汤就有枳实，四逆散也有枳实，为什么会有枳实？枳实真正的功能是怎么样？当我们的胃里面，消化不好的时候，比如这胃里面比较冷，消化不好的时候我们会产生很多的浊水，这个浊水实际上就是食物坏死掉以后那个水留下来的，枳实呢就可以专门针对这个浊水可以把它利掉，所以我们常常会用到枳实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240408083237-qbs6m4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408083237-qbs6m4k","updated":"20240408095447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"129、文字稿：我们在治疗肝脏腹水的时候，我们处方要去救脾脏，如果脾脏能够接受食物的营养，第一个我们就立于不败之地。甘味甜味入脾，所以我们是用甘淡渗利的方式来强脾；"}]},{"ID":"20240408095659-f6h5hnm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408095659-f6h5hnm","updated":"20240408095707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"129.1、在治疗的时候记得甘草不能加！因为甘草会蓄水；"}]},{"ID":"20240408095447-nwk5ou1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408095447-nwk5ou1","updated":"20240408102905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"130、小肠蒸化大肠的食物水→到肺脏→（金生水）到肾→膀胱（二次气化）→肝→（木生火）变成胆汁进入小肠参与循环助消化→（火生土）食物营养到脾脏..."}]},{"ID":"20240408102905-4pmm481","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408102905-4pmm481","updated":"20240408105409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"131、肾水达上焦或脑部有两条通路：一条是通过命门火蒸化顺着督脉达到；一条是顺着肾经冲脉直达舌头喉咙的下方；"}]},{"ID":"20240408105410-4pi1vdk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408105410-4pi1vdk","updated":"20240408113226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"132、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"治肝，必治大肠"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（肝与大肠有一根管道连到）；所以有肝病的人我们一定要先通他的大便。绝对不可以便秘；"}]},{"ID":"20240408113002-u3vxywb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408113002-u3vxywb","updated":"20240408142540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"133、喝酒时候，感觉是表热，嘴巴里面很烫，实际上表热是里寒，它会停积在胃里面，造成胃很难过。"}]},{"ID":"20240408153232-mmegih6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408153232-mmegih6","updated":"20240408153342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"133.1、长期喝酒的人，尽量不要去攻下，因为一般攻下的是寒凉的药，因为本身是酒客，结果肝脏内脏胰脏可能都冷掉了。"}]},{"ID":"20240408153432-ev454gk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408153432-ev454gk","updated":"20240408153552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"133.2、文字稿：所以一般来说，常年喝酒的人如果有便秘的话，我们大概不会选用大黄，我们会用柏子仁、麻子仁，一些仁剂，当归啊来通利他的大便。"}]},{"ID":"20240408142540-au47pne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408142540-au47pne","updated":"20240408154130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"134、中医治疗湿，一定是小便解；"}]},{"ID":"20240408154130-itkiaqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408154130-itkiaqg","updated":"20240408172403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"135、我们治疗肝病和胆病，有几个药一定要会用，所以药性你要很了解，才能敢下重手：茵陈蒿、栀子、大黄、黄柏、黄芩、柏子仁；"}]},{"ID":"20240408162638-msx2j82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408162638-msx2j82","updated":"20240408172345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"135.1、出自文字稿茵陈蒿汤；出自文字稿大黄硝石汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240408172538-dhr7m4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408172538-dhr7m4z","updated":"20240408172947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"135.2、茵陈去黄去湿；栀子去肝胆湿热；黄柏专门治膀胱不利，小便排不出来，膀胱发炎；黄芩治胃炎；柏子仁肝胆方面的润肠剂，通利大便；大黄通利大便；"}]},{"ID":"20240408162241-trlsdsj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408162241-trlsdsj","updated":"20240408173524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"136、判断胆结石：右上腹胁肋里面痛；痛到背后痛到肩膀上；胆石点有压痛；耳朵胆囊点有压痛；"}]},{"ID":"20240408173334-vy9wmt1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240408173334-vy9wmt1","updated":"20240409114649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"137、正常人的身体是上寒下热的；"}]},{"ID":"20240409114643-d0zifcd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409114643-d0zifcd","updated":"20240409115204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"137.1、文字稿——上寒下热的定义：我们人体分两个阶段，肚脐在这边，上面是阳，下面是阴，心脏呢，因为肺是冷的，所以肺把心脏整个包住，热没有办法外散往下走，所以肺主皮毛，所以你摸上身的皮肤，额头、背、通通都是冷的，冰的。只有摸到手掌的时候是热的，因为心经络到了劳宫穴跟少府穴，所以手掌两个是热的。那这个热到了小肠以后了呢，小肠又到了我们两个脚底。大肠叫白肠，小肠前面是膀胱，也是女人的膀胱、也是女人的子宫、卵巢。后面是肾脏，男人的摄护腺（就是前列腺）在下面，这些肾脏啊，这些很多的脏腑把小肠包住，（小肠）里面是很多的津液，所以小肠是很热的，但是外面还是冷的，所以跟上面是雷同，一样的热，这个时候你摸肚子，摸后背，通通都是凉的才对。好，所以脚底是热的，这个叫作常人。这是阴阳相合的时候，是这个结果。"}]},{"ID":"20240409114933-jmcs45z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409114933-jmcs45z","updated":"20240409123938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"138、地仓很大的人，财产很多；天仓很大的人，祖产很多；"}]},{"ID":"20240409123941-z4n7kve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409123941-z4n7kve","updated":"20240409124044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"138.1、文字稿：如果你看到一个人，天仓是凹进去的，地格也是凹进去是，然后精神好好的，在马路上跑，那就是小偷啊，他既败祖业，自己又不留财产；"}]},{"ID":"20240409124044-38frmye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409124044-38frmye","updated":"20240409131956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"139、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"瘀血判断法"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240409131950-86avul7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409131950-86avul7","updated":"20240410095238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（1）是看舌苔，当你看到一个舌苔旁边齿痕，齿痕很重，这种是内有瘀血。"}]},{"ID":"20240409131950-ouwsz50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409131950-ouwsz50","updated":"20240410095241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（2）是看舌头，舌头上面有黑点，也是身体里面有瘀血。"}]},{"ID":"20240409131950-jkrkode","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409131950-jkrkode","updated":"20240410095243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（3）是妇人左侧腹腔这边，一压下去就痛，也是身体里面有瘀血的现象，身体里面有瘀血。"}]},{"ID":"20240409131950-plkdtnh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409131950-plkdtnh","updated":"20240410095245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（4）是唇痿，那嘴巴舌头非常的干燥，又不喜欢喝水，这种就是瘀血。"}]},{"ID":"20240409131950-n1ozu7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409131950-n1ozu7v","updated":"20240410095251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（5）看起来是发热，结果摸他的脉是常脉，烦躁，这都是有阴伏，淤血；"}]},{"ID":"20240409131956-9sxl9c8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409131956-9sxl9c8","updated":"20240409132014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"139.1、阴伏：有东西潜藏在身体里面；"}]},{"ID":"20240409132011-fw4exo4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409132011-fw4exo4","updated":"20240409132352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"140、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"瘀血不去，新血不生，这两者使用标准是怎么样的？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"攻瘀是三，补虚是七，用三七的比例，这是不求有功，但求无过的做法；"}]},{"ID":"20240409132318-hd7o8xr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409132318-hd7o8xr","updated":"20240409145401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"141、常晕车晕船的人，体内有伏饮；"}]},{"ID":"20240409145352-z0xgusp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409145352-z0xgusp","updated":"20240409155518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"142、肚脐以上出血，用柏叶，肚脐以下出血，用阿胶;"}]},{"ID":"20240409155518-d25091y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409155518-d25091y","updated":"20240409163731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"143、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"胰脏癌、胃癌由来文字稿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：我们为什么不赞成病人吃甜的？因为甜的吃下去之后，这个人工糖啊非常的不好，人工糖呢体积非常的小，一点点，吃了太多的人工糖吃到身体里面去以后，我们的细菌跟滤过性病毒嘴巴都很大（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"感觉应该改成小"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"），所以人工糖体积很小，吃进去以后，等于喂食了细菌和滤过性病毒，这个时候他们吃了人工糖之后，排出来的代谢物就是酸，那胃里已经很酸了，再吃人工糖就更酸，那老师我吃蛋糕的时候，喝杯咖啡好不好？咖啡也是酸，几个酸加在一起太多了，酸就会反逆，食道喉癌，日久了就会破洞吐血，胰脏癌，胃癌，都这样来的。"}]},{"ID":"20240409163439-pxxtkpg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409163439-pxxtkpg","updated":"20240409170223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"144、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"文字稿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：我们有好多种泻心汤，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"三黄泻心汤，半夏泻心汤，甘草泻心汤，生姜泻心汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，老师那么多的泻心汤我会搞错，没关系我教你，慢慢教起来哦，我就不相信教你不会。当你胃里面有发炎的时候，黄芩，当你小肠里面有炎的时候，黄连，这就是黄芩和黄连差异的地方，当你心脏过热或是心虚的时候，所谓虚就是阴虚，血不够的时候，舌苔是黄的，就是这个黄连，所以这个黄连呢是入心脏，因为它苦太苦了，苦味入心，心同小肠相表里。黄柏呢跟这里完全不相干，黄柏入膀胱，入水道系统，所以就是这三黄汤...所以就是因为黄芩，黄连，黄柏，三个处方三个药加在一起的时候，它可以从胃里一直消毒到小肠，可以消毒到水的系统，所以就变成解毒汤，身上的毒比如说你是食物中毒，或是肾脏病的尿液回流，这个浊物跑到血里面去，也是解毒汤，这是我给大家一个基本的概念。"}]},{"ID":"20240409170131-b9ajk6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409170131-b9ajk6z","updated":"20240410094852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"145、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"文字稿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：胃里面是虚寒的人呢，如果是发汗或者是攻下，会产生个症状，就叫“胃反”，胃反的症状，朝食暮吐；"}]},{"ID":"20240410094853-muhrf9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410094853-muhrf9t","updated":"20240410095413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"146、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"怎么知道病人是血虚了？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240410095728-67dw2vw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410095728-67dw2vw"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（1）寸口脉微（微则无气，无气则荣虚，荣虚则血不足，血不足则胸中冷。）；"}]},{"ID":"20240410095731-5efl1v9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410095731-5efl1v9","updated":"20240410095806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（2）手掌没有血色，脸色没有血色；"}]},{"ID":"20240410100333-92hbqcs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410100333-92hbqcs","updated":"20240410100651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（3）扶阳脉浮而濇，浮则为虚，濇则伤脾，脾伤则不磨，朝食暮吐；暮食朝吐，宿谷不化，名曰胃反，脉紧而濇，其病难治。（扶阳脉就是冲阳脉，脚上的胃脉；紧脉为寒，瀒脉为虚）"}]},{"ID":"20240410095404-93fbnw2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410095404-93fbnw2","updated":"20240410095409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"146.1、先是阳虚了以后，再影响到血虚。所以经方的观点里面要把阳补足，血才会回来。"}]},{"ID":"20240410095136-n8jplbr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410095136-n8jplbr","updated":"20240410110825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"147、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"文字稿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：怎么知道肝虚呢？很简单嘛，晚上睡的很好就是肝虚嘛，没有东西在里面，睡得不好，常年每天晚上一点到三点醒过来，肝脏就已经有问题了"}]},{"ID":"20240410110826-pfmtshd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410110826-pfmtshd","updated":"20240410152545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"148、一个大原则，要让皮肤变得很好，身上有伏热、伏饮、痰饮通通要先把它去掉，去掉之后我们一养皮肤就会很好；"}]},{"ID":"20240410152420-zu79ddd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410152420-zu79ddd","updated":"20240410155721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"149、口渴一般不用半夏；"}]},{"ID":"20240410155721-f2jslw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410155721-f2jslw1","updated":"20240410162937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"150、肚脐以上为阳，肚脐一下为阴，厚朴能行气转动阴阳气；枳实能行滞气，还有去浊如胃中馊水；"}]},{"ID":"20240410162937-fqkwobx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410162937-fqkwobx","updated":"20240410165756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"151、人的汗液是从肠胃来的；"}]},{"ID":"20240410165756-c7v4xya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410165756-c7v4xya","updated":"20240411092308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"152、下利气者，当利其小便（下利的时候兼有放屁，利其小便就会好）；"}]},{"ID":"20240410162818-oybpxv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240410162818-oybpxv4","updated":"20240411123045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"153、真正人的免疫系统，抵抗力是来自肠胃；"}]},{"ID":"20240411123012-w4jifde","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240411123012-w4jifde","updated":"20240411133940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"154、鹿角胶，鹿角生在头顶上，是督脉之余，用之配伍药剂可将药性透到脑部；"}]},{"ID":"20240411133941-alsur3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240411133941-alsur3h","updated":"20240411170402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"155、汗血同源，夺血者无汗，夺汗者无血；"}]},{"ID":"20240411170402-2zdb72k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240411170402-2zdb72k","updated":"20240412113432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"156、藜芦能去血脉神经里的痰；"}]},{"ID":"20240412113433-pdgi5d8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240412113433-pdgi5d8","updated":"20240412113458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"157、经方中唯一能壮胆气的药——细辛；"}]},{"ID":"20240412113459-c1pye9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240412113459-c1pye9c","updated":"20240412151245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"158、女人呢左边是血，右边是气，所以常态就是这个女的不管她有没有怀孕，左手的脉要比右手脉大，血要大于气。男人呢，气脉，右手要比左手大；"}]},{"ID":"20240412151245-9uov1cx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240412151245-9uov1cx","updated":"20240415092239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"159、阿胶能止月经，所以方剂配伍中恰逢病人月经，不要用到阿胶；"}]},{"ID":"20240411123008-r7az0a3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240411123008-r7az0a3","updated":"20240415115930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"160、小柴胡汤呢，是产后孕妇第一方；"}]},{"ID":"20240415115931-gkex7l8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240415115931-gkex7l8","updated":"20240415173538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"161、甘味能够行阳；"}]},{"ID":"20240415173538-1g7v18f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240415173538-1g7v18f","updated":"20240416085950"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"162、任者妊也，这个任脉如果不通畅，你就没有办法生小孩，没有办法怀孕；"}]},{"ID":"20240416085950-ck1f8ca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240416085950-ck1f8ca","updated":"20240416101944"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"163、阿胶能够止血，但是血很虚的时候，阿胶可以补血，同时呢可以利月经；"}]},{"ID":"20240416101944-stm7mol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240416101944-stm7mol","updated":"20240416113744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"164、子宫有淤血症状："}]},{"ID":"20240416113744-tu9mq9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240416113744-tu9mq9q","updated":"20240416113912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（一）小便不利；"}]},{"ID":"20240415092236-kfsf3ki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240415092236-kfsf3ki","updated":"20240416113914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（二）大便颜色是黑的"}]},{"ID":"20240416113819-bvq5yf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240416113819-bvq5yf8","updated":"20240416113914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（三）常常会发狂（发脾气），善忘"}]},{"ID":"20240416113820-av286lc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240416113820-av286lc","updated":"20240416113915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（四）少腹痛；"}]},{"ID":"20240416113909-o1b2wl0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240416113909-o1b2wl0","updated":"20240416135639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"165、过去经方的观念里认为，六味地黄丸和桂附八味丸都是所谓长寿，让吃的人会长寿的药；"}]},{"ID":"20240416135640-a1qw6mo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240416135640-a1qw6mo","updated":"20240416140029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"166、文字稿：一个人的胖瘦是心脏在决定，你如果心脏有问题，就算你吃素照样胖，你如果心脏很好，你吃荤的照样瘦。所以真正控制我们身体体重的是心脏；"}]},{"ID":"20240416140000-5iv35j6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240416140000-5iv35j6","updated":"20240416140324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"167、一般长寿的人，体型都瘦；"}]},{"ID":"20240416140325-gar5ja9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240416140325-gar5ja9","updated":"20240416162718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"168、文字稿：我们人的心脏呢在控制男人的精，男人的循环系统跟女人的循环系统正好相反，女人的奶水呢是白色的，男人的精是白色的，女人的奶水白色是在胸部，男人的精是在下部，刚好反的。女人的阳在上，男人的阳在下。任何东西产生的纯营养以后哦，这就是 commonsense，你去提炼一个东西就有纯营养，纯营养提炼之后一定有很多残渣，对不对？所以女人奶水的残渣呢就是月经，男人精子的残渣呢就是胡子；"}]},{"ID":"20240416162718-j936kbc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240416162718-j936kbc","updated":"20240417131010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"169、腹气有滞纳时，厚朴能够通能够通上焦胸腹之间的气；"}]},{"ID":"20240417110724-k88qvax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240417110724-k88qvax","updated":"20240417182823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"170、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"藏红花"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"质比较轻，没什么味道，它比较入气分，用于脑部疾病；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"川红花"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"味臭厚味入血分，可用于心脏疾病；"}]},{"ID":"20240417182807-6rrk7hn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240417182807-6rrk7hn","updated":"20240417192342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"171、血管方面的问题常用的三味药："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"川芎，丹皮，桃仁"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，跌打损伤淤伤的时候都可用；"}]},{"ID":"20240416135953-ojpnfrj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240416135953-ojpnfrj","updated":"20240418110230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"172、心脏病血管堵到一定是刺痛，闷痛一定是心气不足；"}]},{"ID":"20240418110224-0eg19ke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240418110224-0eg19ke","updated":"20240418122122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"173、阳中有阴为精，阴中有阳为气；"}]},{"ID":"20240418122122-ksped0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240418122122-ksped0v","updated":"20240418150746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"174、医案：金匮要略篇搜索“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"人纪补充病例"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"”；"}]},{"ID":"20240418150736-9vkprrr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240418150736-9vkprrr","updated":"20240419132133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"175、久病的病人一定是虚的，什么虚？就是气虚血虚；"}]},{"ID":"20240419132133-uekw8xk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240419132133-uekw8xk","updated":"20240419155945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"176、手是心脏在管，当在治疗手的时候，第一个就要想到心脏；"}]},{"ID":"20240419155945-5knxnp5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240419155945-5knxnp5","updated":"20240421111827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"177、治疗肺的疾病的时候，我们很注重病人能不能平躺着睡觉，如果可以平躺，代表肺里面没有积水；"}]},{"ID":"20240421111827-skztbyx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240421111827-skztbyx","updated":"20240421114929"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"178、阿司匹林吃多了，血管容易破裂，可以重用川芎。"}]},{"ID":"20240421114929-ssmd07w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240421114929-ssmd07w","updated":"20240421141744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"179、文字稿：肺气不能固守的时候，病人就会下利，那肛门口就会收不起来，所以你能收紧你的肛门口，那是因为你的肺气很有力；"}]},{"ID":"20240421141740-c9oewkt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240421141740-c9oewkt","updated":"20240421160841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"180、文字稿：诸位只要看到我开辛夷、苍术这两位药，99%都是有鼻窦炎的问题，那还有1%呢，是心脏病。心窍打不开，心闷痛的时候，我会用辛夷花、菖蒲，因为它两个是辛香开窍的嘛，也可以开心脏的窍"}]},{"ID":"20240421112946-elgfil5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240421112946-elgfil5","updated":"20240422113818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"181、砒霜色白，是白信石，是白色里面的纯阳的药；砒霜可以美容；"}]},{"ID":"20240422113801-itqe6ww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422113801-itqe6ww","updated":"20240422113916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"182、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"蝉蜕跟蛇蜕的区别"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"蝉蜕"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"是甲壳类的，外面是骨头里边是肉，所以我们用蝉蜕大部分是四肢关节周围蜕皮；蛇蜕就是肌肉皮肤上的；"}]},{"ID":"20240422113916-yd66zej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422113916-yd66zej","updated":"20240422142611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"183、五脏逼毒法：最后一个提肛发声的动作才是逼毒的动作，做到后来如遇咳吐、吐津液，这是正常的现象。"}]},{"ID":"20240422142147-wgav2ui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422142147-wgav2ui","updated":"20240422142719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"183.1、如果你从头到尾做完五脏逼毒法，你都没有咳、没有吐，没有白津，什么津液都没有生出来，一个是你完全很干净，这个不太可能，第二个是没有做对正确的动作；"}]},{"ID":"20240422142719-yjchhft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422142719-yjchhft","updated":"20240424141756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"184、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"文字稿：奇桓之腑的病，比如说脑、女子胞、子宫卵巢、淋巴腺、乳癌，这些不属于脏腑的，称之为奇桓之腑，都会用到硫磺。这是我们临床上在用的时候，缺的这个东西，经方里面没有；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240424141659-qyum280","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240424141659-qyum280","updated":"20240425165132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"184.1、文字稿出自仲景心法。"}]},{"ID":"20240425165112-huyq2ev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240425165112-huyq2ev","updated":"20240425165503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"185、文字稿：在学中医的时候，不要只看到相生是好的，相克都不好，那你就错了，所谓相克就是必须要有它存在，才能有制衡。自然界之间，生态平衡一定要有制衡，如果你把这个区域的老虎都杀掉了，鹿就会到处繁殖把树破坏掉，因为它要摩擦鹿角，刮它的角嘛，树就会体无完肤，所以老虎狮子吃掉鹿，能取得生态的平衡，人体也是这样的道理"}]},{"ID":"20240425165120-gf5nlak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240425165120-gf5nlak","updated":"20240426151642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"185.1、以上出自仲景心法；"}]},{"ID":"20240425165257-i6d94b1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240425165257-i6d94b1","updated":"20240426151635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"186、正常女孩子每天早上起来的时候，胸部比较敏感，乳头会挺起来。男人每天早上起来会阳举；女孩子吃了石膏乳头会挺起，男人不能把石膏当壮阳药吃，会阳不举。因为女人胸部为阳，男人下腹部为阳。（女人胸部奶水出来是白色的，男人精子排出来是白色的）"}]},{"ID":"20240426151049-n3oa680","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240426151049-n3oa680","updated":"20240426151631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"186.1、以上出自仲景心法；"}]},{"ID":"20240429113536-wsxeqli","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240429113536-wsxeqli","updated":"20240429113630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"187、发黄分"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"阳黄"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"阴黄"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，阳黄颜色是鲜黄的，阴黄是暗黄的，阳黄好治，阴黄不好治；"}]},{"ID":"20240429113628-nmwnncq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240429113628-nmwnncq","updated":"20240429113644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"187.1、阳黄：茵陈蒿汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240429113645-f24gthv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240429113645-f24gthv","updated":"20240429113754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"187.2、阴黄：硝石矾石散；"}]},{"ID":"20240429113755-ljpmhfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240429113755-ljpmhfs","updated":"20240429115408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"188、遇到病人肝癌还没出现腹水的时候，开了治肝的药以后，平常三餐让他吃四神汤，叫他煮薏仁白果芡实莲子（泡软后再煮），肝主筋，甘苦急，急食甘以缓之，平常煮完可以加些蔗糖下去，当成莲子汤来喝。平常在喝这个的时候就是在实脾。"}]},{"ID":"20240429135156-ahv6o1q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240429135156-ahv6o1q","updated":"20240429135204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"188.1、以上出自仲景心法；"}]},{"ID":"20240429115144-eklwkh4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240429115144-eklwkh4","updated":"20240429135231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"189、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"文字稿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"：炮附子跟生附子还有生硫磺最大的差异，扶阳论坛上面我就跟大家介绍过的，炮附子固阳，比如我现在有病了，阳就损失了50%了，如果我们持续的吃炮附子，只能固住50%，没有办法将失去的50%要回来。那所以他们在使用炮附子时候就发现到，炮附子用50克、100克，哎呀这个阳还是没回来，100克下去阳还是没回来，再加100克、200克、300、400 克就这样来的，越用越多，那你方向错了。你如果炮附子维持个五钱八钱都可以了，生附子三钱下去阳就回头了，生附子下去阳还没有回头，就用生硫磺。如果生硫磺下去阳不能回来，那这个人也就差不多了，没有救了；"}]},{"ID":"20240429135222-11747pe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240429135222-11747pe","updated":"20240429135228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"189.1、以上出自仲景心法；"}]},{"ID":"20240507141558-06tcw28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240507141558-06tcw28","updated":"20240507141606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"190、伤到心脏会引发的七种癌症：乳癌、红斑性狼疮、血癌、肺癌、脑瘤、肝癌、淋巴癌；"}]},{"ID":"20240507141607-p67va88","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240507141607-p67va88","updated":"20240507141621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"190.1、出处：仲景心法；"}]},{"ID":"20240429135232-tlo1quy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240429135232-tlo1quy","updated":"20240507141749"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"191、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"文字稿："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄汤，我们又叫做还魂汤。这个病人死掉了吃下去魂都回来了，叫回魂汤啊！那个四逆汤叫做回阳救逆，麻黄汤有个名称叫返魂汤，从阴间回来阳间，你看麻黄重不重要？麻黄也是回阳救逆的，所以回阳救逆也会需要这个麻黄。\n那麻黄汤与四逆汤的差异就是，麻黄汤症的时候病人会全身关节酸痛，人会抽搐挤成一团，你一摸脉，非常的硬，非常的紧绷在那边，麻黄汤症！病人好像快没气了，麻黄汤一下去就解掉了。四逆汤症就是你快死掉了，摸脉也没了，麻黄汤症的脉整个刚硬，整个绷紧在那面，四逆汤症脉是摸不到了，太危险了，已经感觉不到呼吸，你拿棉花放在鼻孔边可能还稍微动一下，那个一摸心，心口有余温，四逆汤下去就好了。所以麻黄汤与四逆汤不太一样，但两个都是回阳救逆的。"}]},{"ID":"20240507141440-35u4p76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240507141440-35u4p76","updated":"20240507141556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"191.1、以上出自仲景心法；"}]},{"ID":"20240906125510-bby2xf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240906125510-bby2xf6","updated":"20240906125619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"192、帕金森手抖，治筋抖抖动吃蔗糖，治肌肉抖动吃麦芽糖；——出自八纲辨证；（笔记-倪海厦-八纲辨证-搜索‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麦芽糖"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"’）"}]},{"ID":"20240906125619-fpcb1nh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240906125619-fpcb1nh","updated":"20240910092942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"193、四逆散治的是阳症的四逆，四逆汤治的事阴症的四逆；——（笔记-倪海厦-经方的应用-搜索‘"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"阳证四逆"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"’）"}]},{"ID":"20240910092943-8y69u92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240910092943-8y69u92"}}]}